// LeadStatsFunnelStage What happened to each cohort client's FIRST consultation only (not "ever", unlike consulted_ever above) — mutually exclusive counts that sum to consulted_ever. This is the drop-off detail: of everyone who booked, how many actually showed up vs cancelled vs no-showed vs are still waiting on a future date.
